 –11 pm and Sat–Sun 11–3 pm.\n\nPublic Records aims to provide a sa
 fer space. We reject all forms of discrimination\, including racism\, mi
 sogyny\, transphobia\, homophobia\, sexism\, and other aggressive behavi
 or. Consent is paramount. Please exist with respect for yourself and tho
 se around you. Anyone found in violation of our rules or safer space pol
 icy will be removed from the venue.\n\nTo share fe\nhttps://dice.fm/even
 t/pynbdy-the-nursery-mare-nara-w-gabby-cocco-rachel-opert-with-special-g
 uest-james-axon-8th-aug-public-records-new-york-tickets
