 ry\, prioritizing sensuality and spirituality over genre adherence. Spi
 ñorita’s own multi-genre and generational love of music goes just as 
 far\, as does Tara’s. For her\, DJing exists beyond the booth\; it’s
  the building of trust and connection between audience and music. Bronx-
 born\, LA based SEEPS is grounded by her Nuyorican heritage. She brings 
 New York City's golden era of dance music UPSTAIRS.\n\n\\-\n\nPublic Rec
 ords aims to provide a safer space. We reject all forms of discriminatio
 n\, including racism\, misogyny\, transphobia\, homophobia\, sexism\, an
 d other aggressive behavior. Consent is paramount. Please exist with res
