DESCRIPTION:A 75-minute immersive experience exploring breath\, sound\, a
 nd meditation led by Manoj Dias. Regulate your nervous system\, reconnec
 t to your senses\, and access clarity through somatic practice.\n\n\\-\n
 \nPublic Records aims to provide a safer space. We reject all forms of d
 iscrimination\, including racism\, misogyny\, transphobia\, homophobia\,
  sexism\, and other aggressive behavior. Consent is paramount. Please ex
 ist with respect for yourself and those around you. Anyone found in viol
