  new album Out Into\, releasing September 18th. Out Into Son Lux's first
  studio album since being nominated for two Oscars and a BAFTA for their
  work on Everything Everywhere All at Once and scoring Marvel’s Thunde
 rbolts\\*. Propulsive\, urgent\, raw\, and vulnerable\, the album strive
 s to question assumptions about how music is made and construct their ow
 n from a molecular level\, cultivating a musical language rooted in curi
 osity and balancing opposites. Over two decades\, the band has released 
 numerous recordings marked by raw emotional intimacy and meticulous elec
 tronic constructions. They have performed at major venues and festivals 
 globally\, and will embark on a world tour supporting the new album this
